<!-- OUR STORY -->
<section class="section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
      <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-right">
        <div class="section-divider mb-3"></div>
        <span class="section-tag"><i class="fas fa-book-open"></i> Our Journey</span>
      <h2 class="section-title text-start">Our Story</h2>
        <p class="content-para">BoviNetra was launched in 2022 when our leadership team took a tour of bovin farms in Uttar Pradesh and Bihar. They observed the real struggle that bovin business owners and farmers face. Paper registers, manual calculations, and delayed cash payments, along with poor herd management, inefficient milk tracking, and loads of problems.</p>
        <p class="content-para">They believed that technology and AI could take bovin farming to new heights, but only if it was built to help bovin farmers in need.</p>
        <p class="content-para mb-0">BoviNetra is a first choice of 1000+ bovin farmers across 12 states, helping them increase their wealth and build more sustainable bovin businesses. Your mobile-first, bovin-ready platform is here.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-left">
        <img src="/assets/images/farmer-app.png" alt="Indian bovin farmer working in field" class="section-img">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MISSION & VISION -->
<section class="section-padding bg-light-green">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="section-divider"></div>
      <span class="section-tag"><i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i> Our Purpose</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Mission &amp; Vision</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">
