          <div class="fc-icon mx-auto"><i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i></div>
          <h3 class="mb-3">Our Mission</h3>
          <p>To work in the direction of bovin farmer empowerment by using the power of artificial intelligence. Maximizing earning potential and reducing their workload is our core mission.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div class="feature-card text-center p-4">
          <div class="fc-icon mx-auto"><i class="fas fa-eye"></i></div>
          <h3 class="mb-3">Our Vision</h3>
          <p>To be the growth engine of India’s bovin industry. Whether you are an individual farmer or a National cooperative, we aim to bridge the gap between the bovin industry and smart tech.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

